1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,093
Questions.

2
00:00:01,093 --> 00:00:10,351
Three things happen: the reporting verb becomes ask; the question goes back to statement order; and do, does and did disappear.

3
00:00:10,351 --> 00:00:13,072
Are you coming becomes he asked whether I was coming.

4
00:00:13,072 --> 00:00:15,976
Do you like tea: he asked whether I liked tea.

5
00:00:15,976 --> 00:00:18,450
Where did you go: he asked where I had gone.

6
00:00:18,450 --> 00:00:21,184
What is your name: she asked what my name was.

7
00:00:21,184 --> 00:00:27,330
A reported question has no question mark, and never put that before if or a wh word.

